          "worked": "$q^2-p^2=-(p-q)(p+q)$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{p}{p+q}+\\frac{q}{p-q}+\\frac{p^2+q^2}{q^2-p^2}&=\\frac{p(p-q)+q(p+q)-(p^2+q^2)}{(p-q)(p+q)}\\\\\\frac{p}{p+q}+\\frac{q}{p-q}+\\frac{p^2+q^2}{q^2-p^2}&=\\frac{p^2-pq+pq+q^2-p^2-q^2}{(p-q)(p+q)}\\\\\\frac{p}{p+q}+\\frac{q}{p-q}+\\frac{p^2+q^2}{q^2-p^2}&=0\\end{align*}$$",
